{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_031670","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"浮在<R=尼加拉瓜湖,Lago Cocibolca>上的火山岛就是奥梅特佩岛。两座火山连在一起，形状像<R=葫芦,porongo>。","cn_control_tokens":"<R=尼加拉瓜湖,Lago Cocibolca> <R=葫芦,porongo>","cn_utf8_bytes":136,"review_flag":"RUBY_LOCALIZED_LATIN_READINGS"},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"那个冒着烟的就是它吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":33,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"对。冒烟的是康塞普西翁火山，偶尔会喷发。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"另一座马德拉斯火山没有喷发记录，山顶是一座破火山口湖。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":81,"review_flag":"AUX_MADERAS_SUBJECT_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"破火山口湖吗……只希望地下别又藏着什么工厂。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":66,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"你在说什么啊！","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":21,"review_flag":"JPN_EXASPERATED_TONE_PRIMARY"},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"如果和平行者的核武器在这里爆炸，可能会影响地下岩浆，让火山再次喷发。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":102,"review_flag":"AUX_ERUPTION_CONSEQUENCE_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"真变成那样，<R=祖国,尼加拉瓜>就完了。一定要阻止和平行者，Snake！","cn_control_tokens":"<R=祖国,尼加拉瓜>","cn_utf8_bytes":91,"review_flag":"RUBY_LOCALIZED_PROPER_NAME"}]}